  "id": "fearful-attachment",
  "term": "fearful attachment",
  "definition": "Fearful attachment is an adult attachment style marked by a negative view of both oneself and other people. A person may want close relationships to make up for low self-worth, but avoid them because they expect others to be untrustworthy or rejecting.",
